; Audi A6 (4B)
;
; Component: J429 - Central Locking (#35)
;
; P/N: 4B0-962-258-???
;
; includes measuring blocks, coding and adaptation
;
; created on 06/Jun/2001 by Paul Cunningham (cunningham64@home.com)
; updated on 18/Aug/2010 by Sebastian Stange (Sebastian@Ross-Tech.com)
;
; last modification on 18/Feb/2012
;
; requires VCDS 805.0 or newer
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; measuring blocks
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
001,0,Driver Door Status
001,1,Key Switch,Driver Door,Range: open/close/not operated
001,2,Interior Locking,Switch (E150),Range: lock/unlock/not operated
001,3,Feedback,Driver Door,Range: locked/unlocked
001,4,SAFE-Feedback,Driver Door,Range: safe/not safe
;
002,0,Passenger Door Status
002,1,Key Switch,Passenger Door,Range: open/close/not operated
002,3,Feedback,Passenger Door,Range: locked/unlocked
002,4,SAFE-Feedback,Passenger Door,Range: safe/not safe
;
003,0,Rear Door Status
003,1,Feedback,Rear Right Door,Range: locked/unlocked
003,2,SAFE-Feedback,Rear Right Door,Range: safe/not safe
003,3,Feedback,Rear Left Door,Range: locked/unlocked
003,4,SAFE-Feedback,Rear Left Door,Range: safe/not safe
;
004,0,Door Contact Switches
004,1,Door Contact,Driver's Door,Range: Door OPEN/Door CLOSED
004,2,Door Contact,Passenger Door,Range: Door OPEN/Door CLOSED
004,3,Door Contact,Rear Right Door,Range: Door OPEN/Door CLOSED
004,4,Door Contact,Rear Left Door,Range: Door OPEN/Door CLOSED
;
005,0,Rear Lid/Tailgate
005,1,Key Switch,Rear Lid/Tailgate,Range: open/close/not operated
005,2,Feedback,Rear Lid/Tailgate,Range: Lid open/Lid closed
005,3,Remote Control,Rear Lid/Tailgate,Range: open/not operated
005,4,Softtouch,Rear Lid/Tailgate,Range: open/not operated
;
006,1,Interior Light,,Range: ON/OFF
006,2,Terminal 15,Shut-Off Delay,Range: Relay ON/Relay OFF
006,3,Comfort Operation,Remote Control,Range: open/close/not operated
006,4,Trunk Light,,Range: ON/OFF
;
007,0,Remote Control
007,1,Active,Remote Control,Range: 0.0...4.0 (0 = Remote Control not operated / 1...4 = Remote Control Memory Location)
007,2,Active Command,Remote Control,0 = not operated / 1 = operated\n\nxxx? = Panic (North-American-Region only)\nxx?x = Rear Lid\nx?xx = Close\n?xxx = Open
007,3,Key Positions,,0 = not occupied / 1 = occupied\n\nxxx? = Memory Location 1\nxx?x = Memory Location 2\nx?xx = Memory Location 3\n?xxx = Memory Location 4
;
008,1,Vehicle Speed
008,2,Immobilizer,Authorization,Range: ON = Authorization OK / OFF = Authorization NOT OK
;
009,0,Coding
009,1,Coding I,,?0x = Remote Control\nx0? = Unlocking Conformation via Remote Control
009,2,Coding II,,?xxx = Door/Window Regulator Logic\nx?xx = Anti-Theft-System Confirmation (via Siren/Horn)\nxx?x = Locking Conformation via Remote Control\nxxx? = Lichtsteuerung Avant ODER Alarmzyklus Sounder
009,3,Coding III,,?xxx = Right-Hand-Drive (RHD)\nx?xx = Comfort Operation via Remote Control\nxx?x = Auto-Lock/Unlock\nxxx? = Rear Lid/Tailgate locked above 5 km/h
009,4,Coding IV,,?xxx = Anti-Theft-System\nx?xx = Selective Central Locking (SCL)\nxx?x = Anti-Theft-System Confirmation (via Turn Signals)\nxxx? = Rear Lid/Tailgate Unlocking
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Central Locking (J429) Coding
C01,+000001 = Rear Lid/Tailgate Unlocking active
C02,+000002 = Anti-Theft-System Confirmation (via Turn Signals)
C03,+000004 = Selective Central Locking (SCL)
C04,+000008 = Anti-Theft-System installed
C05,+000016 = Rear Lid/Tailgate locked above 5 km/h
C06,+000032 = Auto-Lock/Unlock (Locking at 15 km/h)
C07,+000064 = Comfort Operation via Remote Control active
C08,+000128 = Right-Hand-Drive (RHD) Vehicle
C09,+000256 = Alarm Type/Cycle for Sound Rest of World (RoW)
C10,+000512 = Locking Conformation via Remote Control (1x Turn Signals) active
C11,+001024 = Anti-Theft-System Confirmation (via Siren/Horn)
C12,+002048 = Door/Window Regulator Logic (North-American-Region only / Terminal 87)
C13,+004096 = Unlocking Conformation via Remote Control (2x Turn Signals) active
C14,+008192 = SAFE-Function inactive (North-American-Region only)
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; adaptation
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
A021,0,Remote Control Adaptation (Memory Location)
A021,5,Remote Control Adaptation (Memory Location)
A021,6,Enter the desired Memory Location for the Key/Remote (1-4) which you want to adapt.
A021,7,Once you saved the Value press either the OPEN or CLOSE Button on the Remote Control.
A021,8, 
A021,9,Additional Keys/Remotes can be Adapted while choosing a different Memory Location.
A021,10,Repeat these steps until all Keys/Remotes have been adapted.
;
